        <div class="menu-placeholder reveal">
          <div><span>[01] Hungry?</span><strong>Mains</strong><p>Filling buns and bites.</p></div>
          <div><span>[02] Sweet tooth?</span><strong>Desserts</strong><p>Cakes and sweet treats.</p></div>
          <div><span>[03] Thirsty?</span><strong>Beverages</strong><p>Milkshakes, coffee and tea.</p></div>
