        <div class="about-copy reveal">
          <div class="section-label">[04] Our place</div>
          <h2>COME AS<br>YOU <em>ARE.</em></h2>
          <p>JOHNNYZ. is a relaxed café-style hangout on Galle Road, Dehiwala. Whether you're catching up with friends, grabbing a takeaway or stopping by for dessert, there's room for a simple good moment.</p>
          <p>Good food, friendly service and an easy-going atmosphere — just the way a neighbourhood spot should feel.</p>
          <a class="button" href="#visit">Plan your visit ↗</a>
        </div>
